OL,3,GNEWSADUP leader 'very sorry' Carla
OL,4,ALockhart has quit the party
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on Tuesday, Robinson said the
OL,7,Fdisagreement was over strategy not
OL,8,Fsentiment.
